  "gloss": "to struggle; to writhe; to flounder",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to struggle; to writhe; to flounder",
      "explanation": "To thrash about with the arms and legs trying to get free or to stay afloat; figuratively, to struggle desperately to get out of a hard situation."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "32545_mogaku_ex1",
