  "notes": "Intransitive and godan: もがく, もがいた. Also written {踠|もが}く, but kana is usual.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{必死|ひっし}→必死：03705_hisshi⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧もがく: to struggle desperately\n- もがき{苦|くる}しむ: to writhe in agony; to struggle painfully\n- 〜よう⟦と→と：00512_to⟧もがく: to struggle to ~\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{足掻|あが}く→足掻く：23198_agaku⟧: to struggle — close; also of struggling in vain (⟦{今更|いまさら}→今更：01743_imasara⟧⟦{足掻|あが}いて→足掻く：23198_agaku⟧⟦も→も：00484_mo⟧⟦{無駄|むだ}→無駄：02512_muda⟧だ)\n- ⟦{苦|くる}しむ→苦しむ：01938_kurushimu⟧: to suffer — the pain, not the thrashing",
